## Done when
Each new or changed line is one short sentence and cites its sources exactly as given: evidence IDs, the week record wk-1, or owner notes (n-N). No line repeats another. At most 24 lines in all. summary says what changed in one sentence. Answer with drop, lines and summary. drop lists the IDs that no longer hold. Each item in lines is {"id", "text", "sources"}: id is "new" or the ID of the line you change, text is the line in plain words with no IDs in it, and sources lists each ID it rests on once. If nothing changed, lines and drop are empty and summary says No change.

